\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces Rhythm alignment, schematically. The PDF-derived score contributes the pitch sequence but no timing (top); the matched MIDI performance contributes onset times (bottom). Needleman--Wunsch alignment pairs the two note sequences, absorbing local insertions such as the ornamental F\#4 as gaps, and each PDF note receives the inter-onset interval of its MIDI counterpart as its duration.}}{22}{figure.4.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:alignment}{{4.2}{22}{Rhythm alignment, schematically. The PDF-derived score contributes the pitch sequence but no timing (top); the matched MIDI performance contributes onset times (bottom). Needleman--Wunsch alignment pairs the two note sequences, absorbing local insertions such as the ornamental F\#4 as gaps, and each PDF note receives the inter-onset interval of its MIDI counterpart as its duration}{figure.4.2}{}}
